    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i don't have a fever or anything, and i feel mostly fine otherwise... just a bit uncomfortable. it's kinda hard to get to a clinic right now and it's late. wouldn't it be okay to just take a couple of advil and see if it goes away by morning? i really hate the idea of sitting in an er waiting room for hours just for gas.",
